-- Cech comparison of affine covers (2026-10-30, second part).
-- Five modules: lambda on an open of a slice read on X (SerreLambdaNested);
-- lambda at a unit multiple (SerreLambdaUnit); a quasi-coherent module is
-- lambda-local on every open, and torsors have sections on affine opens
-- (SerreLambdaQuasiCoherent); Cech H1 along a refinement: restriction of
-- cocycles, its torsor description, additivity, bijectivity
-- (SerreCechRefinement); the canonical isomorphism of H1 for two finite
-- affine covers through their concatenation (SerreCechComparison).
-- Openings are structural carriers, slice and restriction maps used by
-- definition, the torsor/cocycle records, and Trunc.carrier.
